<http://data.silknow.org/object/643262c5-59e4-36c6-baad-23dfd3866548/observation/5>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/historical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This marionette appeared in <i>Tricks with Strings</i>, a performance on the 29th April 2018 as part of the V&A Performance Festival. The puppeteers included Ronnie Le Drew, Susan Dacre, Keith Frederick, Siân Kidd, and Eti Meacock. The performance was directed by Rachel Warr."@en ;
